        "title": "Nobody home",
        "text": "Walker Lake tops the nitrogen list — your coworker nods, satisfied, and points you to the radio room. But when you get there it's empty: a chair overturned, headphones on the floor, everyone gone in a hurry. A note is left behind — an exploration pilot is missing, last known to be flying over the lake with the highest chloride. You'd better find out which lake that is.",
        "button": "Enter the radio room →"
      },
